        "question": "A 50-year-old male presents with massive splenomegaly and a severely elevated white blood cell count (predominantly neutrophils and myelocytes). Genetic testing reveals a t(9;22) translocation. Which of the following tests helps differentiate this from a leukemoid reaction?",
