        "correct": 2,
        "exp": "Because the testes descend from the abdomen during embryogenesis, they drag their blood supply and lymphatic drainage with them. Testicular tumors metastasize first to the para-aortic (lumbar) lymph nodes. Scrotal skin drains to superficial inguinal nodes.",
