        "question": "A 45-year-old female presents with fatigue, weight gain, and cold intolerance. Physical exam reveals an enlarged, non-tender thyroid gland. Laboratory tests show high TSH and low free T4. Histology of the thyroid reveals a dense lymphocytic infiltrate with germinal centers and Hurthle cells. What is the most likely diagnosis?",
