        "question": "A 60-year-old male presents with a sudden onset, left-sided varicocele that does not empty when he lies down. While varicocele is usually a benign anatomical issue in young men, new onset in an older male is highly suspicious for obstruction of the left renal vein by which specific malignancy?",
