        "question": "A 30-year-old sexually active male develops multiple reddish-brown papules on the glans penis. Biopsy reveals severe squamous dysplasia, but it does not invade the basement membrane. Unlike Bowen disease, this condition typically affects younger patients and often regresses spontaneously. What is it?",
