        "question": "A 45-year-old HIV-positive patient of African descent presents with rapidly progressive nephrotic syndrome and renal failure. Light microscopy of the glomerulus reveals collapse of the entire capillary tuft with severe podocyte hyperplasia. What specific variant of FSGS is this?",
