        "question": "A 2-year-old boy presents with painless lower gastrointestinal bleeding. A nuclear medicine scan utilizing Tc-99m pertechnetate shows an ectopic focus of uptake in the right lower quadrant. This congenital anomaly is a remnant of the:",
