        "exp": "This is a ruptured ectopic pregnancy, a surgical emergency. The vast majority (>95%) of ectopic pregnancies implant in the fallopian tube, specifically within the ampulla. Risk factors include scarring from Pelvic Inflammatory Disease (PID) or endometriosis.",
