        "exp": "Fibrocystic change is the most common benign breast condition. The classic triad of cysts (blue-dome cysts), fibrosis, and apocrine metaplasia carries absolutely NO increased risk for breast cancer. Risk only increases if there is atypical epithelial hyperplasia.",
