        "exp": "HER2/neu (ERBB2) encodes a cell surface epidermal growth factor receptor with intrinsic Tyrosine Kinase activity. When amplified, it constantly signals the cell to divide. It indicates an aggressive tumor but allows for targeted therapy with Trastuzumab (Herceptin).",
