        "exp": "Autoimmune Metaplastic Atrophic Gastritis (AMAG) features autoantibodies against parietal cells and intrinsic factor. It selectively destroys the body and fundus (where parietal cells live), sparing the antrum. The lack of intrinsic factor leads to Vitamin B12 deficiency (pernicious anemia and neurological symptoms).",
        "book": "Robbins & Cotran Pathologic Basis of Disease",
        "subtopic": "Stomach Pathology"
