        "topic": "Gastrointestinal",
        "difficulty": "Normal",
        "source": "Pathoma",
        "question": "A 10-year-old girl is diagnosed with Celiac disease. Her intestinal biopsy shows crypt hyperplasia and villous atrophy. Which specific portion of the gastrointestinal tract typically shows the most severe histological damage in Celiac disease?",
