        "difficulty": "Hard",
        "source": "Kaplan",
        "question": "A patient living in the Caribbean presents with chronic diarrhea, weight loss, and a megaloblastic anemia. Intestinal biopsy shows villous blunting and lymphocytes in the lamina propria. He does not respond to a gluten-free diet but improves dramatically with broad-spectrum antibiotics and folate acid supplementation. Diagnosis?",
