        "source": "Pathoma",
        "question": "A 55-year-old male with a known neuroendocrine tumor of the small bowel metastasized to the liver presents with flushing, diarrhea, and a heart murmur. He also develops a scaly dermatitis, dementia, and diarrhea. The tumor's massive consumption of which amino acid has led to this secondary vitamin deficiency?",
