        "exp": "Carcinoid tumors secrete serotonin, which is synthesized from Tryptophan. A massive metastatic carcinoid tumor can divert so much tryptophan toward serotonin synthesis that the body cannot synthesize Niacin (Vitamin B3). This leads to Pellagra (the 3 Ds: Dermatitis, Diarrhea, Dementia).",
