        "question": "A 35-year-old female presents with severe abdominal pain, massive ascites, and tender hepatomegaly. She has a known history of Polycythemia Vera. Ultrasound shows absent blood flow in the hepatic veins. What is the classic histological finding in the liver of this patient?",
