        "question": "A 60-year-old male who worked in a chemical manufacturing plant for 30 years presents with right upper quadrant pain and weight loss. Imaging reveals an aggressive, highly vascular tumor in the liver. Biopsy cells stain strongly positive for CD31 (an endothelial marker). This rare Hepatic Angiosarcoma is classically associated with occupational exposure to which specific compound?",
