        "exp": "Multiple Myeloma is a plasma cell malignancy that overproduces monoclonal immunoglobulin light chains. These light chains misfold and deposit in tissues (including the kidney mesangium) as Primary (AL) Amyloidosis. Congo red stain with apple-green birefringence is pathognomonic for amyloid.",
