        "question": "A 7-year-old boy presents with palpable purpura on his buttocks and legs, abdominal pain, and gross hematuria following a viral upper respiratory infection. Renal biopsy would show immune complex deposition predominantly in the mesangium. What is the composition of these deposits?",
