        "question": "A 30-year-old female presents with severe hypertension, hypokalemia, and metabolic alkalosis. Laboratory tests show extremely low levels of both Renin and Aldosterone. Genetic testing reveals an autosomal dominant gain-of-function mutation in the epithelial sodium channel (ENaC). Diagnosis?",
