        "exp": "Multiple Myeloma Cast Nephropathy (Myeloma Kidney) occurs when massive amounts of monoclonal light chains (Bence Jones proteins) are filtered into the urine. They combine with Tamm-Horsfall proteins to form dense, obstructive casts in the distal tubules, which elicit a foreign-body giant cell reaction.",
