        "exp": "WAGR syndrome (Wilms tumor, Aniridia, Genital anomalies, Retardation) is a classic contiguous gene deletion syndrome. It is caused by the deletion of the WT1 tumor suppressor gene and the adjacent PAX6 gene (which causes aniridia) on Chromosome 11p13.",
