        "correct": 3,
        "exp": "Chronic rejection occurs months to years after transplantation. It is characterized by chronic inflammation leading to fibrosis. The hallmark lesion in the kidney is concentric intimal thickening of the blood vessels (transplant vasculopathy), leading to chronic ischemia and interstitial fibrosis.",
