        "question": "A patient with long-standing rheumatoid arthritis develops a severe, progressive restrictive cardiomyopathy. A biopsy of the myocardium is stained with Congo Red. Under polarized light, the tissue exhibits an apple-green birefringence. What is the exact precursor protein that has deposited in this patient's heart?",
