        "source": "Pathoma",
        "question": "A 25-year-old African male presents with progressive right-sided heart failure. Echocardiography shows massive, dense endocardial thickening obliterating the ventricular cavities. Biopsy shows dense fibrosis of the endocardium and inner myocardium without eosinophilia. What is the diagnosis?",
