        "question": "A 30-year-old female presents with severe abdominal pain, psychological disturbances, and port-wine colored urine. She reports these attacks often happen when she drinks alcohol or takes certain medications. Her skin is completely normal, with no blistering or photosensitivity. What enzyme is deficient in this specific porphyria?",
