        "source": "Robbins",
        "question": "A 60-year-old male with a long-standing history of severe heartburn (GERD) undergoes an endoscopy. The pathologist finds metaplastic columnar epithelium with goblet cells in the lower esophagus. What is the fundamental molecular mechanism driving this specific type of cellular adaptation?",
