        "question": "A 45-year-old alcoholic male recovers from a severe bout of acute pancreatitis. Four weeks later, he develops a palpable epigastric mass. Imaging reveals a large cystic structure. What type of epithelial lining covers the inside of this pancreatic pseudocyst?",
