        "question": "A 7-year-old girl is brought to the ER with lethargy, vomiting, and confusion. She had a mild viral fever three days ago, and her parents gave her an over-the-counter pain reliever containing aspirin. A liver biopsy is performed. What is the classic histological finding in Reye Syndrome?",
