        "question": "A 3-year-old child living in an old apartment building presents with severe abdominal pain, constipation, and developmental delay. Peripheral blood smear reveals microcytic anemia with prominent basophilic stippling in the RBCs. The heavy metal poisoning in this patient inhibits which two specific enzymes in the heme synthesis pathway?",
