        "question": "A 40-year-old female presents with extremely dry eyes, a dry mouth (xerostomia), and bilateral enlargement of her parotid glands. Labs reveal positive Anti-SSA (Ro) and Anti-SSB (La) antibodies. A biopsy of her minor salivary glands would most likely show which characteristic finding?",
