        "question": "A 12-year-old boy has a history of severe, recurrent episodes of acute pancreatitis since early childhood. There is a strong family history of the disease. Genetic testing reveals a gain-of-function mutation in the PRSS1 gene. What is the precise consequence of this mutation?",
