        "question": "A patient with severe acute pancreatitis rapidly deteriorates in the intensive care unit. He develops severe hypoxemia and bilateral pulmonary infiltrates ('white out') on chest X-ray. His heart is functioning normally. What is the mechanism linking his exocrine pancreatic disease to this catastrophic pulmonary failure?",
