        "question": "A 50-year-old male underwent a surgical resection of a parotid gland tumor six months ago. He now complains that every time he eats or smells food, the skin over his jaw and cheek becomes severely flushed and he sweats profusely from that area. What is this syndrome, and what causes it?",
