        "question": "A 25-year-old female with a history of bulimia nervosa presents with bilateral, painless enlargement of her parotid glands. The physician notes no inflammation, no tenderness, and normal saliva flow. What is the histological hallmark of this specific, non-neoplastic condition (Sialadenosis)?",
