        "question": "A 55-year-old alcoholic male is suspected of having chronic pancreatitis and exocrine pancreatic insufficiency, but his serum amylase and lipase are normal. Which non-invasive stool test is the most sensitive and specific marker for diagnosing severe exocrine pancreatic insufficiency?",
