        "exp": "Verruca Vulgaris (common warts) are caused by Human Papillomavirus (HPV). The pathognomonic histological hallmark of an HPV infection in squamous epithelium is the Koilocyte: an enlarged keratinocyte with an irregular, 'raisin-like' nucleus surrounded by a prominent clear halo.",
