        "question": "A 25-year-old sexually active male presents with a diffuse, copper-colored maculopapular rash that conspicuously involves the palms of his hands and the soles of his feet. He also has broad, flat, moist, warty-looking lesions in his perianal region. What is the name of these highly contagious perianal lesions?",
