        "question": "An 80-year-old male presents with a rapidly expanding, bruise-like, purple patch on his scalp that has recently ulcerated and begun bleeding. Biopsy reveals highly atypical endothelial cells forming irregular, jagged vascular channels dissecting through the dermal collagen. What is this highly aggressive malignancy?",
