        "question": "A 30-year-old male eats a strawberry and develops intensely pruritic, elevated, erythematous plaques (wheals) all over his torso within 20 minutes. The lesions disappear completely within 24 hours without any scarring. This acute Urticaria (hives) is characterized histologically by:",
