        "source": "Pathoma",
        "question": "A fetus is noted to have a massive, translucent, cystic mass on the back of the neck on ultrasound. After birth, this mass is identified as a Cystic Hygroma. This benign vascular tumor is a classic hallmark of which chromosomal abnormality?",
