        "question": "A pregnant female notices a rapidly growing, red, polypoid nodule on her gums that bleeds very easily when brushing her teeth. Biopsy shows an ulcerated lesion packed with proliferating capillaries and edema. What is this benign lesion, which often regresses after delivery?",
